<title>USA: CSCE Brazil differential coffee stocks rise.</title>
<headline>CSCE Brazil differential coffee stocks rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The amount of coffee stored in warehouses and certified for delivery against Coffee, Sugar and Cocoa Exchange's Brazilian Differential futures contract was 574 60-kg bags as of Jan 24, up 287 bags from the previous week.</p>
<p>There were 287 bags housed in New Orleans warehouses and 287 bags in Jacksonville warehouses.</p>
<p>There were no bags pending classification or certification in New York, San Francisco, Houston, or Norfolk.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodities Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
